From: Ritesh Patel <DECRUX9812@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 03:26:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): surface real Bot Mode attention states

Expose a content-free per-session awaiting-input index to plugins, show canonical Bot Chats that genuinely need input, and derive Working now from exact per-session busy state or worker heartbeats instead of recent messages.
